<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"> <id>https://finnchou.github.io/</id><title>Finn's blog</title><subtitle>Finn 的技术博客：计算机视觉、Camera 成像、色彩科学与数字图像处理。</subtitle> <updated>2026-11-04T11:15:30+08:00</updated> <author> <name>Finn.Zhou</name> <uri>https://finnchou.github.io/</uri> </author><link rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" href="https://finnchou.github.io/feed.xml"/><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="zh-CN" href="https://finnchou.github.io/"/> <generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator> <rights> © 2026 Finn.Zhou </rights> <icon>/assets/img/favicons/favicon.ico</icon> <logo>/assets/img/favicons/favicon-96x96.png</logo> <entry><title>光谱渲染：给一间像素小屋打光</title><link href="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Spectral-Pixel-Lighting/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="光谱渲染：给一间像素小屋打光" /><published>2026-11-01T12:00:00+08:00</published> <updated>2026-11-02T21:27:47+08:00</updated> <id>https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Spectral-Pixel-Lighting/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Spectral-Pixel-Lighting/" /> <author> <name>Finn.Zhou</name> </author> <category term="色彩科学" /> <summary>用 C 语言逐波长计算一间像素小屋里的光：从光源光谱乘反射率的单点颜色讲起，依次加上提灯的衰减、遮挡、窗外的日光与天光、墙面间的反射和色调映射，配代码与渲染图，附交互演示。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>白平衡的 p 范数：从灰色世界到 Max-RGB</title><link href="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Minkowski-White-Balance/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="白平衡的 p 范数：从灰色世界到 Max-RGB" /><published>2026-10-31T00:05:51+08:00</published> <updated>2026-10-31T00:05:51+08:00</updated> <id>https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Minkowski-White-Balance/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Minkowski-White-Balance/" /> <author> <name>Finn.Zhou</name> </author> <category term="色彩科学" /> <summary>灰色世界让各通道的平均相等，Max-RGB 让最大值相等，二者是 p 范数的两端。本篇从这两个假设讲到 Shades of Gray，在 Cube++ 上实测并附交互演示，最后谈它与卷积网络池化的关系。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>色差公式的演进：从 CIELAB 到 CIEDE2000</title><link href="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Color-Difference-Formulas/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="色差公式的演进：从 CIELAB 到 CIEDE2000" /><published>2026-10-21T22:45:18+08:00</published> <updated>2026-10-22T23:11:27+08:00</updated> <id>https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Color-Difference-Formulas/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Color-Difference-Formulas/" /> <author> <name>Finn.Zhou</name> </author> <category term="色彩科学" /> <summary>CIELAB 的欧氏距离并不能准确反映色差。本篇梳理 CMC、CIE94 到 CIEDE2000 的演进，看每项修正对应椭圆的哪种变形；最后指出 L1、L2 损失也是一种色差，同样带着偏向。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>色温的刻度：倒数色温</title><link href="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Reciprocal-Color-Temperature/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="色温的刻度：倒数色温" /><published>2026-10-12T21:02:16+08:00</published> <updated>2026-10-22T23:08:52+08:00</updated> <id>https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Reciprocal-Color-Temperature/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Reciprocal-Color-Temperature/" /> <author> <name>Finn.Zhou</name> </author> <category term="色彩科学" /> <summary>同样相差 100 K，低色温端的色差是高色温端的十倍以上。本篇介绍倒数色温（mired）：它为什么能让色温的刻度变得均匀，与色差的关系，以及在色温转换滤镜与相关色温计算中的用法。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>白点切换：色适应与 Bradford 变换</title><link href="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Chromatic-Adaptation/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="白点切换：色适应与 Bradford 变换" /><published>2026-10-09T21:40:36+08:00</published> <updated>2026-10-22T23:03:18+08:00</updated> <id>https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Chromatic-Adaptation/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://finnchou.github.io/posts/Chromatic-Adaptation/" /> <author> <name>Finn.Zhou</name> </author> <category term="色彩科学" /> <summary>sRGB 的白点是 D65，ICC 的中转空间是 D50，相机的场景白点随照明而变，颜色在其间流转都要切换白点。本篇从 Luther 条件与 von Kries 假说讲起，介绍色适应与 Bradford 变换。</summary> </entry> </feed>
